{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "81ce97a0-dd3f-4548-ace4-436557fdde5d",
    "name": "Inventario ADSO — RBAC Completo",
    "description": "Colección completa del Sistema de Inventario ADSO con autenticación JWT y autorización RBAC.\n\n**Cómo usar:**\n1. Configura la variable `URL_API` (ej: http://localhost:3000)\n2. Ejecuta primero '1. Registrar Admin' y '2. Registrar User'\n3. Ejecuta '3. Login Admin' — el token se guarda automáticamente en `TOKEN_ADMIN`\n4. Ejecuta '4. Login User' — el token se guarda automáticamente en `TOKEN_USER`\n5. El resto de peticiones usan los tokens automáticamente\n\n**Variables automáticas guardadas:**\n- `TOKEN_ADMIN` — token del administrador\n- `TOKEN_USER` — token del usuario regular\n- `REFRESH_TOKEN_ADMIN` — refresh token del admin\n- `PRODUCT_ID` — ID del último producto creado\n- `CATEGORY_ID` — ID de la última categoría creada",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "52923475"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Registrar Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201 - Usuario creado', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Respuesta tiene formato correcto', () => {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.success).to.be.true;",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data).to.have.property('id');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.role).to.eql('admin');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Admin Sistema\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@inventario.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin123!\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{URL_API}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{URL_API}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Registra un usuario con rol ADMIN.\nEl campo `role` es opcional — si no se envía, se asigna 'user' por defecto."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Registrar User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201 - Usuario creado', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Rol asignado es user por defecto', () => {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.role).to.eql('user');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Usuario Regular\",\n  \"email\": \"usuario@inventario.com\",\n  \"password\": \"User123!\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{URL_API}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{URL_API}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Registra un usuario con rol USER (por defecto, sin enviar el campo role)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Login Admin 🔑",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 - Login exitoso', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Respuesta incluye accessToken', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data).to.have.property('accessToken');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Respuesta incluye folleto de permisos', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.user).to.have.property('permissions');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.user.permissions).to.be.an('array');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.user.permissions.length).to.be.above(0);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Admin tiene permiso users.read', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.user.permissions).to.include('users.read');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Guardar tokens automáticamente",
                  "if (body.data && body.data.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('TOKEN_ADMIN', body.data.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('REFRESH_TOKEN_ADMIN', body.data.refreshToken);",
                  "  console.log('✅ TOKEN_ADMIN guardado correctamente');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@inventario.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin123!\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{URL_API}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{URL_API}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Login del admin. Guarda automáticamente TOKEN_ADMIN y REFRESH_TOKEN_ADMIN en las variables de la colección."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Login User 🔑",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 - Login exitoso', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('User solo tiene permisos de lectura', () => {",
                  "  const perms = body.data.user.permissions;",
                  "  pm.expect(perms).to.include('products.read');",
                  "  pm.expect(perms).to.include('categories.read');",
                  "  pm.expect(perms).to.not.include('products.create');",
                  "  pm.expect(perms).to.not.include('users.read');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Guardar token automáticamente",
                  "if (body.data && body.data.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('TOKEN_USER', body.data.accessToken);",
                  "  console.log('✅ TOKEN_USER guardado correctamente');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"usuario@inventario.com\",\n  \"password\": \"User123!\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{URL_API}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{URL_API}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Login del usuario regular. Guarda automáticamente TOKEN_USER."
          },
          "response": []
        },
